0..74 Comment "//! A theory states that an operation is commutative, by a rule that swaps"
75..97 Comment "//! its two arguments."
98..101 Comment "//!"
102..179 Comment "//! The meet of two tallies is one value in each order of its arguments. Each"
180..256 Comment "//! rule must rewrite, and a rule that swaps two arguments has no direction."
257..309 Comment "//! So each reader of the rules must know that form."
310..313 Comment "//!"
314..391 Comment "//! The rule `meet x y <=> meet y x` is a symmetry, and no reader rewrites by"
392..470 Comment "//! it. Each rule beside it rewrites as before. A model of the theory owes the"
471..540 Comment "//! law as a member. A case on the terms owes its respect of the law."
541..544 Comment "//!"
545..561 Comment "//! - see: #8291"
